title: A Word from a Bloc Leader
subtitle: A Senate leader wants something from the Caucus.
tags: event
view-if: lm_ready and not finale and not game_ending
priority: 2
new-page: true
face-image: img/ev_senate.svg
on-arrival: {! SW.leaderMomentOpen(Q); !}

= [+ lm_title +]

**[+ lm_leader +]** of the [+ lm_group_name +] is [+ lm_reason +]. *[+ lm_motive +]*

[? if lm_ultimatum : "[+ lm_ask +]" ?][? if not lm_ultimatum : [+ lm_offer +] [+ lm_leader +] asks what the Caucus needs. ?]

*Leaders' moods follow what they care about and what they remember of the Caucus. An angry leader holds their bloc's line harder, in votes and in coalitions; a pleased one bends.*

- @accept: [+ lm_label +]
- @refuse: Refuse.
- @vote: Ask them to back our next reform bill.
- @capital: Ask for their help in the corridors.
- @thank: Thank them, and ask for nothing.

@accept
view-if: lm_ultimatum
subtitle: [+ lm_accept_sub +] [+ lm_leader +] will remember it.
choose-if: treasury >= lm_cost
unavailable-subtitle: The treasury cannot afford it.
on-arrival: {! SW.leaderMomentResolve(Q, 'accept'); !}

The [+ lm_group_name +] get what they asked for. [+ lm_leader +] makes sure the Senate knows who delivered it.

@refuse
view-if: lm_ultimatum
subtitle: [+ lm_refuse_sub +] [+ lm_leader +] will hold it against us.
on-arrival: {! SW.leaderMomentResolve(Q, 'refuse'); !}

The Caucus will not be dictated to. [+ lm_leader +] leaves without a word, and the [+ lm_group_name +] close ranks.

@vote
view-if: not lm_ultimatum
subtitle: The [+ lm_group_name +] lean our way on our next reform vote.
on-arrival: {! SW.leaderMomentResolve(Q, 'vote'); !}

[+ lm_leader +] promises the [+ lm_group_name +]'s support when our next reform reaches the floor.

@capital
view-if: not lm_ultimatum
subtitle: +1 political capital.
on-arrival: {! SW.leaderMomentResolve(Q, 'capital'); !}

A few doors open, a few favours are called in, and the Caucus finds its work a little easier.

@thank
view-if: not lm_ultimatum
subtitle: Better relations, and a little goodwill banked.
on-arrival: {! SW.leaderMomentResolve(Q, 'thank'); !}

The Caucus asks for nothing, and [+ lm_leader +] remembers that too.
